{"suttaId":"thig5.10","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Thī","vriCode":"s0509m.mul","paras":[450,466],"vripara":"112"},"segments":{"thig5.10:0.3":"Paṭācārātherīgāthā","thig5.10:1.1":"“Naṅgalehi kasaṃ khettaṃ, bījāni pavapaṃ chamā;","thig5.10:1.3":"Puttadārāni posentā, dhanaṃ vindanti māṇavā.","thig5.10:2.1":"“Kimahaṃ sīlasampannā, satthusāsanakārikā;","thig5.10:2.3":"Nibbānaṃ nādhigacchāmi, akusītā anuddhatā.","thig5.10:3.1":"“Pāde pakkhālayitvāna, udakesu karomahaṃ;","thig5.10:3.3":"Pādodakañca disvāna, thalato ninnamāgataṃ.","thig5.10:4.1":"“Tato cittaṃ samādhesiṃ, assaṃ bhadraṃvajāniyaṃ;","thig5.10:4.3":"Tato dīpaṃ gahetvāna, vihāraṃ pāvisiṃ ahaṃ;","thig5.10:4.5":"Seyyaṃ olokayitvāna, mañcakamhi upāvisiṃ.","thig5.10:5.1":"“Tato sūciṃ gahetvāna, vaṭṭiṃ okassayāmahaṃ;","thig5.10:5.3":"Padīpasseva nibbānaṃ, vimokkho ahu cetaso”ti.","thig5.10:6.1":"… Paṭācārā therī …."},"attha":{"book":"Thī-a","bookName":"Therīgāthā-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0509a.att","from":1780,"to":1780,"paras":[{"para":1780,"vripara":null,"refs":["thig5.10:5"],"words":["sūciṃ","vaṭṭiṃ okassayāmī","vimokkho","cetaso"],"lines":["<b>Sūcin</b>ti aggaḷasūciṃ.","<b>Vaṭṭiṃ okassayāmī</b>ti dīpaṃ vijjhāpetuṃ telābhimukhaṃ dīpavaṭṭiṃ ākaḍḍhemi.","<b>Vimokkho</b>ti kilesehi vimokkho.","So pana yasmā paramatthato cittassa santati, tasmā vuttaṃ <b>“cetaso”</b>ti.","Yathā pana vaṭṭitelādike paccaye sati uppajjanāraho padīpo tadabhāve anuppajjanato nibbutoti vuccati, evaṃ kilesādipaccaye sati uppajjanārahaṃ cittaṃ tadabhāve anuppajjanato vimuttanti vuccatīti āha –","“padīpasseva nibbānaṃ, vimokkho ahu cetaso”ti."],"lineRefs":[["thig5.10:5"],["thig5.10:5"],["thig5.10:5"],["thig5.10:5"],["thig5.10:5"],["thig5.10:5"]]}]},"tika":null}
